            "review_title": "Review at Chue Quy Khack Ngon Mieng",
            "review_text": "Ian O\n27 contributions\n0\nAmazing food...Lots of!!\nMar 2024 • Couples\nMy wife and I ate here whilst in HCMC. The food is amazing and plentiful so don't do what we did and order two starters and 2 mains, having said that even if you did, it is cheap as our bottle of wine cost more than our meal. It is frequented by locals so their English isn't good, but Google translate is your friend. Do not let this one slip you by.\nWritten March 6, 2024",
